# examples/regressions/arena_loadstore — the §16 arena-mmap sub-crumb B fixture
# (`docs/design/plano-s16-arena-mmap.md` §7, crumb B): proves the C-leg `load_u64`/`store_u64`
# emitters round-trip a real 64-bit word through raw mmap'd memory. Combines crumb A's
# `syscall6`/`syscall2` mmap/munmap intrinsics with crumb B's `teko::mem::store_u64`/`load_u64`
# emitters (`emit_store_u64`/`emit_load_u64`, `src/codegen/codegen.tks`) to store a sentinel word
# into a fresh anonymous page and read it back before releasing the page. A SELF-CONTAINED
# project (its own local copy of the `SYS_MMAP`/`SYS_MUNMAP`/`PROT_*`/`MAP_*` consts under
# `src/sys/sys.tks`), same rationale as `examples/regressions/sys_mmap`: the real `teko::sys`
# lives in the COMPILER's own project (root `teko`, reserved) and an external standalone project
# has no visibility into it.
name = "arena_loadstore"
source = "src"

